  "name": "Necromancer minions have live-scaled health at level 60",
  "contract": [
    "Live combat logs and a live A/B test (owner +8 Stamina gave Ghoul +10, Warrior +20, Abomination +60 health)",
    "fit minion health = b x the owner's naked health + h x the minion's inherited Stamina, where the minion",
    "inherits 0.2714 x Life Force x owner Stamina (whole points), h = 10 health per Stamina (Ghoul 5) and b =",
    "0.54 for Skeletal Warriors, 0.66 for the Ghoul and 1.38 for the Abomination. A naked level-60 Undead",
    "Necromancer has 68 Stamina and 1956 naked health, so: Lesser Skeletal Warrior 1236 (old formula 5254); Ghoul",
    "1381 (old formula 5254); Abomination 3249 (old formula 15262). Expected: within 5%. Power Word: Fortitude",
    "(+115 Stamina) on the owner raises the inherited Stamina by 31 for the Warrior and 93 for the Abomination:",
    "310 and 930 health."
  ],
